00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.270
Where's Sophia?

2
00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:06.060
I fired her.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.060
Why?

4
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.060
Why?

5
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.060
I just don't like her.

6
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:13.060
Vincent, you can't always be so willful.

7
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:17.060
Evelyn, the wedding venue is set on an island.

8
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.060
