16
00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.340
Uncle Arthur. He said we're going to be engaged soon.

17
00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:56.340
No wonder he insisted I come.

18
00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.340
This one's not bad. Get me the sample dress to try on.

19
00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:05.270
Okay.

20
00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:08.270
Miss Evelyn, your custom gown has arrived.
